<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8" />
  <title>LayoutTranslateBench — Leaderboard</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Public leaderboard for LayoutTranslateBench (LTB), the first benchmark for document translation with layout preservation. Scored on chrF, layout IoU, and reading-order Kendall tau." />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <meta name="keywords" content="document translation, layout preservation, OCR, benchmark, chrF, IoU, Kendall tau, localization, PDF translation, layout-aware translation" />
  <meta name="robots" content="index, follow" />
  <meta property="og:title" content="LayoutTranslateBench Leaderboard" />
  <meta property="og:description" content="The first public benchmark for document translation that scores layout fidelity and reading order alongside translation quality." />
  <meta property="og:type" content="website" />
  <meta property="og:site_name" content="LayoutTranslateBench" />
  <meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image" />
  <meta name="twitter:title" content="LayoutTranslateBench Leaderboard" />
  <meta name="twitter:description" content="Public leaderboard for document translation that scores layout fidelity and reading order alongside translation quality." />
  <link rel="canonical" href="" />
  <script type="application/ld+json">
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@type": "Dataset",
    "name": "LayoutTranslateBench",
    "alternateName": "LTB",
    "description": "Public benchmark for document translation with layout preservation. Composite score LTB-100 combines chrF (text quality), layout IoU, and reading-order Kendall tau.",
    "license": "https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0",
    "creator": {"@type": "Organization", "name": "LayoutTranslateBench Contributors"},
    "keywords": ["document translation", "layout preservation", "OCR", "benchmark", "localization"],
    "version": "{{ version }}"
  }
  </script>
  <style>
    :root { color-scheme: light dark; --bg:#0e0f14; --fg:#e8e6e3; --muted:#a9a39b; --accent:#7cb7ff; --card:#16181f; --hi:#27306b; }
    @media (prefers-color-scheme: light) {
      :root { --bg:#fdfdfd; --fg:#1a1a1a; --muted:#666; --accent:#0a58c9; --card:#fff; --hi:#dde7ff; }
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    body { background:var(--bg); color:var(--fg); font:15px/1.55 ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif; margin:0; padding:24px 16px 64px; }
    main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; }
    h1 { font-size: 28px; margin: 0 0 6px; }
    p.lead { color: var(--muted); margin: 0 0 28px; max-width: 720px; }
    .meta { color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; margin-bottom: 24px; }
    .card { background: var(--card); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px; overflow:auto; box-shadow: 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.04), 0 8px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.08); }
    table { width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    th, td { padding: 10px 12px; text-align: left; white-space: nowrap; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(127,127,127,0.18); }
    th { font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; }
    tbody tr:hover { background: var(--hi); }
    .num { text-align: right; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
    .badge { display:inline-block; padding: 2px 8px; border-radius: 999px; font-size:11px; background:rgba(127,127,127,0.18); color:var(--muted); }
    .badge.verified { background: rgba(40,180,99,0.15); color:#43c178; }
    .links { margin-top: 28px; color: var(--muted); }
    .links a { color: var(--accent); margin-right: 16px; }
    .empty { padding: 24px; text-align:center; color: var(--muted); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main>
    <h1>LayoutTranslateBench Leaderboard</h1>
    <p class="lead">The first public benchmark for document translation that scores layout fidelity and reading order alongside translation quality. Composite score <strong>LTB-100</strong> combines chrF (text), layout IoU (visual), and reading-order Kendall tau.</p>
    <div class="meta">Generated {{ generated_at }} from LayoutTranslateBench v{{ version }}.</div>

    <div class="card" style="background: rgba(255,200,90,0.06); border-left: 3px solid #f0a000; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 20px;">
      <strong>Caveat — v0.1 sample size.</strong> All scores are computed on N=5 documents per language pair. The <em>LTB-100</em> cell shows
      <code>point [95% CI]</code> via 1000-resample percentile bootstrap. The CI on N=5 is <em>wide</em> — small differences between systems are not
      statistically significant. v0.2 will scale to N≥25 per pair.
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin: 24px 0 8px;">End-to-end systems</h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Runners that produce their own bounding boxes — the realistic score.</p>
    <div class="card">
      {% if end_to_end %}
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="num">#</th>
            <th>System</th>
            <th class="num">LTB-100 [95% CI]</th>
            <th class="num">chrF</th>
            <th class="num">Layout IoU</th>
            <th class="num">Reading-order τ</th>
            <th class="num">Coverage</th>
            <th class="num">Parser fails</th>
            <th class="num">Median s/doc</th>
            <th class="num">Cost USD</th>
            <th>Hardware</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for r in end_to_end %}
          <tr>
            <td class="num">{{ r.rank }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ r.system_name }}</strong> <span class="badge">v{{ r.system_version }}</span></td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.ltb_100) }} <span style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px;">[{{ "%.1f"|format(r.ltb_100_ci_low) }}, {{ "%.1f"|format(r.ltb_100_ci_high) }}]</span></td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.chrf) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.4f"|format(r.layout_iou) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.4f"|format(r.reading_order_tau) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ r.coverage }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ r.parser_failures if r.parser_failures else "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ ("%.2f"|format(r.median_runtime_s)) if r.median_runtime_s is not none else "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ ("$%.4f"|format(r.cost_usd)) if r.cost_usd is not none else "—" }}</td>
            <td>{{ r.hardware or "—" }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">No end-to-end submissions yet. See <a href="../docs/submission.html">submission guide</a> to be the first.</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <h2 style="margin: 32px 0 8px;">Oracle-layout reference <span class="badge" style="font-size: 11px; vertical-align: middle;">text-quality ceilings</span></h2>
    <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom: 12px;">Runners given <em>ground-truth bounding boxes</em> as predictions — they only translate the text. These are <strong>upper bounds on text quality</strong>, not realistic end-to-end measurements of the underlying products. Use for comparing translation quality in isolation from layout extraction.</p>
    <div class="card">
      {% if oracle %}
      <table>
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th class="num">#</th>
            <th>System</th>
            <th class="num">LTB-100 [95% CI]</th>
            <th class="num">chrF</th>
            <th class="num">Coverage</th>
            <th class="num">Median s/doc</th>
            <th class="num">Cost USD</th>
            <th>Hardware</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          {% for r in oracle %}
          <tr>
            <td class="num">{{ r.rank }}</td>
            <td><strong>{{ r.system_name }}</strong> <span class="badge">v{{ r.system_version }}</span></td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.ltb_100) }} <span style="color: var(--muted); font-size: 12px;">[{{ "%.1f"|format(r.ltb_100_ci_low) }}, {{ "%.1f"|format(r.ltb_100_ci_high) }}]</span></td>
            <td class="num">{{ "%.2f"|format(r.chrf) }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ r.coverage }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ ("%.2f"|format(r.median_runtime_s)) if r.median_runtime_s is not none else "—" }}</td>
            <td class="num">{{ ("$%.4f"|format(r.cost_usd)) if r.cost_usd is not none else "—" }}</td>
            <td>{{ r.hardware or "—" }}</td>
          </tr>
          {% endfor %}
        </tbody>
      </table>
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">No oracle-layout submissions yet.</div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>

    <div class="links">
      <a href="../BENCHMARK.html">Specification</a>
      <a href="../docs/methodology.html">Methodology</a>
      <a href="../docs/submission.html">Submit</a>
      <a href="../docs/citation.html">Cite</a>
      <a href="../docs/faq.html">FAQ</a>
      <a href="https://github.com/Lawrenzho-bit/LayoutTranslateBench">GitHub</a>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
